 "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/De0mgVbtXE-/",
 "title": "How to Fix Boring Video Scripts with Rhythm",
 "topic": "content creation",
 "summary": "The creator claims that videos sound boring when they lack rhythm. To fix this, mix short sentences (no more than five words) between long ones to create a long-short-long-short pattern.",
 "key_points": [
  "Videos sound boring when they lack rhythm and all sentences are long.",
  "Add short sentences between longer ones with no more than 5 words.",
  "This creates a long-short-long-short pattern that gives the script a more interesting rhythm.",
  "This idea was inspired by @kallaway."
 ],
 "content": "How should creators write their script? Make a note of this post. The reason why most of your videos sound so boring is because they don't have 'rhythm'. Take a look at this script, if all your sentences are long like this, then of course it's gonna sound boring. So do this instead: add short sentences between with no more than 5 words. This creates a long, short, long, short pattern, giving your script a more interesting rhythm. Take a look: is it possible to study for 24 hours in a public library? Let's find out. I first have to find a local library that opens for 24 hours. But there was a problem. See? It sounds much better. This idea was inspired by @kallaway. Go check out his videos. God bless you.",
 "status": "done",
